0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
51.0236220472441033 643.4648031496062686 Td
(ABSTRACT / RESUMEN CL�NICO) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
51.0236220472441033 626.4569291338582389 Td
(Background:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
51.0236220472441033 615.1183464566928478 Td
(Post-dural puncture headache \(PDPH\) is a common adverse effect following lumbar puncture or epidural breach. Traditional treatments) Tj
T* (include bed rest, hydration, and epidural blood patch \(EBP\). This multicenter prospective trial evaluated intravenous aminophylline as a safe) Tj
T* (and effective therapeutic option.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
51.0236220472441033 582.8033858267715459 Td
(Study Design:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
51.0236220472441033 571.4648031496062686 Td
(Prospective multicenter clinical study involving 128 consecutive patients diagnosed with moderate-to-severe PDPH following diagnostic or) Tj
T* (therapeutic lumbar puncture across 4 tertiary hospitals.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
51.0236220472441033 549.9214960629921052 Td
(Intervention:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
51.0236220472441033 538.5829133858267141 Td
(Patients received a single intravenous infusion of 250 mg aminophylline in 100 mL of 0.9% normal saline administered over 30 minutes.) Tj
T* (Visual Analog Scale \(VAS\) pain scores were recorded at baseline \(0 min\), 30 min, 2 h, 24 h, and 48 h.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
51.0236220472441033 517.0396062992125508 Td
(Results:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
51.0236220472441033 505.7010236220472166 Td
(The mean baseline VAS score was 7.72 � 1.15. Following aminophylline administration, mean VAS scores decreased significantly to 4.84 �) Tj
T* (1.42 at 30 minutes, 2.31 � 1.18 at 2 hours, and 0.81 � 0.95 at 48 hours \(P < 0.001 at all time points\). The overall treatment response rate at) Tj
T* (48 hours was 93.8% \(120/128 patients\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
51.0236220472441033 473.3860629921259147 Td
(Conclusion:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
51.0236220472441033 462.0474803149605805 Td
(Intravenous injection of aminophylline provides rapid, dramatic, and sustained pain relief in PDPH with high clinical efficacy and an excellent) Tj
T* (safety profile, representing an effective first-line therapy before considering an epidural blood patch.) Tj
ET
