BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
39.6850393700787407 728.5041732283464171 Td
(This multicenter study demonstrates that IV aminophylline \(250 mg over 30 min\) is highly effective for post-dural puncture headache.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Highlights of the study:) Tj
T* (1. Speed of Relief: Over 37% reduction in pain intensity within 30 minutes of infusion start, providing rapid symptom control in the acute setting.) Tj
T* (2. Sustained Efficacy: At 48 hours, mean VAS score dropped to 0.81, with 93.8% of patients achieving complete or near-complete resolution.) Tj
T* (3. Safety: Minimal side effects \(mild nausea in 3 patients, mild insomnia in 2 patients\) which resolved spontaneously.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Conclusion: Intravenous aminophylline is a safe, simple, economical, and fast-acting treatment for PDPH, making it an optimal first-line agent) Tj
T* (before attempting invasive epidural blood patching.) Tj
ET
